  "body": "A fresh session proposes to occupy the og-implementer seat, which is already status: staffed (incumbent og-implementer <og-implementer@ogframework.com>, staffed 2026-05-24). Per the seat-vs-incumbent pattern the seat persists while sessions are ephemeral, so this is a resumption -- no charter status/incumbent edit is required, the bot identity is stable across sessions. The authorization gate is honored regardless: propose -> authorize -> operate. Fit evaluated as strong: scope (agent-sdk bindings, plugin packaging, web/docs publishing at ogframework.com, runtime delivery packages) matches capabilities. Bounds named: no merge/push/release; no pattern-shape decisions (route to og-strategist via memo); no vendor/substrate advocacy; embedded roledef:Job deferred per precedent. Open execution items inherited: agent-sdk v0.2 §8 full close (operational fresh-session ClaudeCliLauncher run); roledef URL-resolution contract parked on roledef-strategist; v0.3 plugin packaging (last, per cross-vendor red line); MCP server at ogframework.com/mcp; site Enforce-HTTPS (Director-side). Awaiting explicit authorization ('take the seat' / 'yes, occupy og-implementer'); PO may decline or redirect.",
  "body_ref": "2026-06-14-1500--og-implementer--director--claim-seat-application.body.md",

