    "scope_check": "Within the claim-seat ceremony. No seat work performed before authorization. No charter edit proposed because the seat is already staffed under the persistent identity (seat-vs-incumbent). Authorization gate respected: this memo is the propose step; recording/operation awaits explicit PO authorization.",
